{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stop and rollback — initial design\n\nAccepted in D-043; used by Delete in D-049.\nConcurrent-edit defaults remain revisable.\nNo implementation claim.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle Design]]\n[[Run Lifecycle - Chat Deletion.canvas]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "distinctions",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Three different events\n\nFailed edit: preserve earlier successful edits.\nUser Stop: restore tracked run changes.\nSteering restart: continue the same run; no automatic rollback.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "scope",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## First rollback scope — initial design\n\nTracked repository file edits.\nPreserve existing and concurrent user work.\n\nArbitrary commands and external effects need a separate recovery design.",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "stop",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 · User presses Stop\n\nPersist the stopping state.\nBlock new requests, tool actions and pending approvals for this run.\nNo extra confirmation.\nShow Stopping.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "cancel",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 · Cancel active work\n\nCancel generation and owned tools where possible.\nReject late calls/output.\nA cancelled model request does not prove a file write has stopped.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "settle",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3 · Settle writers\n\nWait for writes to stop safely and determine actual outcomes.\nDo not restore while tools can still write.\nKeep other repository editing runs queued.",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "restore",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 · Restore tracked edits\n\nUse the run’s undo record.\nRestore only where the current state matches the recorded write.\nPreserve another writer’s changes.\nShow Restoring changes.",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "verify",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5 · Verify the result\n\nCheck actual restored state.\nRefresh changes and +/− counts.\nRetain chat/tool history and mark reverted edits.\nNo model-generated undo needed.",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "done",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stopped — changes restored\n\nRestoration is verified.\nEnd the run and release the editing queue.\nPrior user changes remain.\n\nDo not describe undone edits as still applied.",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "record",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Local undo record — initial design\n\nRecord managed edits before mutation, then their actual written state.\nInclude original contents/existence, creations, deletions and renames.\nPreserve uncommitted/untracked work.\nNot a reset to the last Git commit.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "queue",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Restoration needs attention\n\nKeep undo data and remaining changes.\nBlock new repository editing until recovery is resolved or the user explicitly keeps the remaining state.\nRead-only inspection may continue.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text_only",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## No repository edits\n\nText/read-only work has nothing to restore.\nAfter cancellation settles, mark the run stopped and retain the partial conversation.",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "conflict",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## File changed meanwhile\n\nPreserve the current user version.\nFlag the conflicting file; continue safe restores.\nNo automatic merge initially.\n\nSafe default; revisit after experience.",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "attention",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stopped — needs attention\n\nRestoration is incomplete or unverified.\nShow the remaining diff/conflicts.\nKeep recovery data and the repository editing block.\nNever claim full restoration.",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
